# Ensemble — `string` ensemble (NEW per P1.1f / R32 corpus probe).
# Note: `string length`/`compare`/`match`/`range` are specialized to
# strlen/strcmp/strmatch/strrangeImm and emit no `::tcl::string::*`
# literal — they produce no walker event for ensemble dispatch (their
# specialized opcodes are P1.2 metric-walker concerns, not pattern
# dispatch). Only `string repeat` (and other unspecialized subcommands)
# falls through the ensemble path.
string repeat x 3
---
  ensemble          cmd=1 ensemble=string subcommand=repeat arg_count=3
